{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is named <strong>\u00bf\u00a0Y ?</strong>. It would be kind of strange for us to put something concrete here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides, it\u2019s not like people read this anyway. Most people just skip around the thumbnails and then scroll up and scan the page. At the end of the day, the cover is what will really catch your attention \u2014 that, or the fact that you saw a streamer playing this game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do you keep going?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do I keep going?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just play the game already \u2014 we\u2019re running out of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wow, they say <i>Fortune</i> favors the brave, but I guess it favors persistence as well. Fine... Here you go:\u00a0In a world where everything is designed to catch your attention and squeeze your dopamine receptors dry, you\u2019ll join <i>Cubert</i>\u00a0in his everlasting journey of completing just one more lap. And, much like life (in case the laps metaphor wasn\u2019t clear enough), there might just be something more awaiting for you at the start of the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00bf Y ? play this game, then:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>three-act, short Sisyphean walking narrative</strong>, you\u2019ll uncover the answers to the very questions that set <i>Cubert</i> off on his journey in the first place.\u00a0As the story unfolds, you\u2019ll face a series of <strong>challenges and minigames</strong> that will shift and mirror the protagonist\u2019s inner turmoil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll through a <strong>condensed, introspective experience</strong> designed to be played in a single session, one that invites you to confront your own existential questions along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to what is being said  for hidden within this <strong>minimalistic world</strong> are the clues to what\u2019s yet to come.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064500?t=1762029191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064500?t=1762029191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064500/8c6cb70e14415bde033122435e25fa68ddca2b64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762029191","capsule_imagev5":"